#CONSTRAINTS

Build strictly for:
- Cloudflare free tier
- Supabase free tier

Rules:
- Keep frontend static/hybrid
- Avoid heavy SSR
- Avoid chat systems
- Avoid video/media-heavy features
- Keep DB < 500MB
- Keep storage < 1GB
- Minimize egress and writes

If a feature increases:
- CPU usage
- request volume
- storage size

→ simplify or remove it
